This repository contains a Lean 4 proof that 1, ζ(2) and ζ(3) are linearly independent over ℚ.

The Lean code was written with substantial assistance from AI systems (Anthropic Claude, OpenAI Codex).

It includes code adapted from the following Apache-2.0 projects. Each adapted file names its source in a comment.

